{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1541","id":4039538771,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87wxnhT","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1541","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1541.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1541.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1541","number":1541,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: recover 9709 E1 membership commitment","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Scope\n\nParentCreationGate prerequisite repair only: recover the historical E1 60-row development membership and make its mainline commitment machine-verifiable. This is not Campaign A and performs no VLM/provider call.\n\n## Root cause\n\nThe existing E1 commitment only asserted `mainline_membership_commitment_verified=false`; it did not preserve a machine-readable 60-row manifest or verify the historical protocol/input bytes. The gate therefore had to keep `e1_60_mainline_membership_commitment_not_verifiable` open.\n\n## What changed\n\n- recovered exactly 60 unique `stable_question_id` values from the immutable protocol input manifest at `5eebef3055554ad33cbdba0cbc07d2754dc0d370`\n- added closed membership and commitment schemas\n- bound each member to its historical input row, image hash, and source PDF hash\n- added canonical membership SHA-256, Merkle root, historical artifact hashes, deterministic readback, and validator result\n- marked historical accepted 4 / blocked 56 outcomes as non-authoritative for membership conservation\n- bound future sealed-holdout and vertical-slice selectors to exclude the E1 membership\n- upgraded the ParentCreationGate formal/checkout loaders and E1 validator; reviewed inventory is now 45 paths\n- added 17 fail-closed fixture classes and mutation tests\n- hardened formal E1 validation after review to parse fixed canonical origin/main bytes, hash exact manifest bytes, validate repo-relative paths, and fail closed on resolver ancestry errors\n- added portable fresh-clone verification pinned to exact membership bytes/canonical/Merkle and historical artifact hashes while retaining full byte readback whenever the immutable historical objects are locally available\n\n## Verified evidence\n\n- member conservation: 60/60\n- unique: 60; duplicate: 0; null/sentinel: 0\n- historical input references: 60/60\n- input image hashes: 60/60\n- source PDF hashes: 60/60\n- historical input artifacts: 3/3\n- historical result artifacts: 5/5\n- membership manifest SHA-256: `d0441c2194f1eb226c08866e4fa80873b26af2d8e1e7d55eea803adc8d00a464`\n- canonical membership SHA-256: `2bb6eef3a1f1fd9755dbf060a5c4582d1f6fa7b353cb25d6279ae953694b96ac`\n- Merkle root SHA-256: `27f63dad10e525425f0868ddc63e469ad9ec427e8a3b3c2af8febeb7b580613c`\n\n## Validation\n\n- focused related tests: `54 passed`\n- builder drift: `31 artifacts`, pass\n- checkout ParentCreationGate contract: pass; E1 check passes\n- formal ParentCreationGate: expected `NO-GO` because these PR artifacts are not yet on `origin/main`\n- secret findings: 0\n- holdout findings: 0\n- raw/Gold/provider payload key findings: 0\n- copied binary/PDF/render findings: 0\n- `git diff --check`: pass\n- final preflight: clean and synchronized after push\n\n## Remaining checkout blockers\n\n- `independent_review_pending_or_changes_required`\n- `owner_approved_repo_external_durable_root_and_readback_missing`\n- `role_access_acl:actual_campaign_principals_not_configured`\n- `role_access_acl:append_only_access_log_not_verified`\n\n## Fixed boundaries\n\n- provider calls = 0\n- remote Supabase/Storage/Vector/RAG writes = 0\n- Campaign A issues = 0\n- actual holdout members selected = 0\n- new Gold rows = 0\n- accepted rows = 0\n- canonical promotion = 0\n- no AO\n- no actual durable root/ACL configuration\n\nDo not merge automatically; keep this PR draft for CI and review.","created_at":"2026-07-12T16:24:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T02:19:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T02:19:17Z","merged_at":"2026-07-13T02:19:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"3dd185c78f130095a9a36a0494efa3818fbd6c2f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1541/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1541/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1541/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/102f2d654c6fc5ed2762a33d166759936f1805cc","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/9709-pg-e1-membership-recovery","ref":"codex/9709-pg-e1-membership-recovery","sha":"102f2d654c6fc5ed2762a33d166759936f1805cc","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"h